1594_p0140a01","n":"0140a","t":"相應分別十散動分別謂諸菩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0140b01","n":"0140b","t":"諸佛世尊於大乘中說方廣教"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0140c01","n":"0140c","t":"此疑說變化喻世尊依何密意"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0141a01","n":"0141a","t":"無我無二寂靜不寂靜無二有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0141b01","n":"0141b","t":"自性三對治祕密謂於是處說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0141c01","n":"0141c","t":"分別一切菩薩等所求智得佛"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0142a01","n":"0142a","t":"礙而行忍故為欲攝受一切善"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0142b01","n":"0142b","t":"一故無雜染心故如是諸句應"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0142c01","n":"0142c","t":"人趣諸有情處數皆無量念念"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0143a01","n":"0143a","t":"故所取能取性現前故一時現"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0143b01","n":"0143b","t":"故菩薩譬如幻師於所幻事於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0143c01","n":"0143c","t":"名事互為客其性應尋思於二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0144a01","n":"0144a","t":"故於此設離六種波羅蜜多現"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0144b01","n":"0144b","t":"由戒波羅蜜多故於諸有情能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0144c01","n":"0144c","t":"能真實品別知法故名為慧云"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0145a01","n":"0145a","t":"是名菩薩純善意樂如是菩薩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0145b01","n":"0145b","t":"利是名勝利如是六種波羅蜜"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0145c01","n":"0145c","t":"清淨義第七地中由種種法無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0146a01","n":"0146a","t":"得諸地深信解故二得正行謂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0146b01","n":"0146b","t":"即此無功用行補特伽羅從此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0146c01","n":"0146c","t":"證無上正等菩提又諸菩薩現"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0147a01","n":"0147a","t":"情雖行邪行而不棄故四現前"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0147b01","n":"0147b","t":"所知彼岸云何綺間語若正說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0147c01","n":"0147c","t":"於如所說無分別智成立相中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0148a01","n":"0148a","t":"如虛空無染是無分別智種種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0148b01","n":"0148b","t":"鬼傍生人天各隨其所應等事"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0148c01","n":"0148c","t":"世出世滿中說此最高遠若諸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0149a01","n":"0149a","t":"諸菩薩住下劣轉有何過失不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0149b01","n":"0149b","t":"諸佛法身以何為相應知法身"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0149c01","n":"0149c","t":"由佛土自身相好無邊音聲無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0150a01","n":"0150a","t":"無量依止差別轉故應知變化"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0150b01","n":"0150b","t":"遍一切行住無非圓智事一切"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0150c01","n":"0150c","t":"諸佛事相雜猶如大海水我已"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0151a01","n":"0151a","t":"息故五者如來受大富樂應修"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0151b01","n":"0151b","t":"復次受用如是清淨佛土一向"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0151c01","n":"0151c","t":"可見故二無量佛眾會差別可"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1594_p0152a01","n":"0152a","t":"竟住一所作究竟成熟有情已"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T31n1594-攝大乘論","source":"CBETA T31n1594 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":58,"unit":"T31 頁欄"}